@server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5185

### Premium methods
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/premium-methods
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/premium-methods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "methodNumber": "PM-001",
  "description": "Sample premium method",
  "premiumPercentage": 12.5,
  "calculationPeriod": 1
}

### Metrics
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/metrics?premiumMethodId=1
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "premiumMethodId": 1,
  "name": "CPI Metric",
  "description": "Consumer price index",
  "sourceType": 1,
  "importFrequency": 1
}

### File definition + field mapping for metric 1
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/metrics/1/file-definitions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sheetName": "Sheet1",
  "headerRowNumber": 1,
  "setAsActive": true,
  "fieldMappings": [
    { "excelColumnName": "Region", "systemFieldName": "region", "dataType": 1, "isRequired": true, "displayOrder": 1 },
    { "excelColumnName": "Value", "systemFieldName": "value", "dataType": 2, "isRequired": true, "displayOrder": 2 },
    { "excelColumnName": "Date", "systemFieldName": "date", "dataType": 3, "isRequired": false, "displayOrder": 3 }
  ]
}

### Fields & filters available for a metric
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/metrics/1/fields
Accept: application/json

### Import history
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/import-history?metricId=1
Accept: application/json

### Dynamic data query for a metric
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/metrics/1/data/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filters": [
    { "field": "value", "operator": "range", "value": "10", "valueTo": "30" }
  ],
  "sortField": "value",
  "sortDirection": "desc",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 20
}
